WEBVTT

00:04:28.509 --> 00:04:30.128
He leaned in and he whispered,

00:04:30.152 --> 00:04:32.077
"Don't you see?

00:04:32.101 --> 00:04:33.763
They smoke cigarettes."

00:04:33.787 --> 00:04:35.089
(Laughter)

00:04:35.806 --> 00:04:37.444
"And they drink beer."

00:04:38.669 --> 00:04:42.161
Danny had learned, of course,
about the evils of drinking and smoking.

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:45.236
Then he said, "And they carry guns."

00:04:46.342 --> 00:04:48.773
In one of the pictures,

00:04:48.797 --> 00:04:53.811
the stick figures of the Revos Locos
are shooting at birds and at people.

00:04:53.835 --> 00:04:58.724
Danny told me about the day his uncle
was killed by those Revos Locos

00:04:58.748 --> 00:05:01.675
and how he ran from his house
to his uncle's farmhouse,